<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park vs F-9 Park Islamabad"
  description="Lake View Park vs F-9 Park Islamabad: how the lakeside park and the city’s Fatima Jinnah Park differ, and which suits which visitor."
  path="/lake-view-park-vs-f9-park/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What’s the difference between Lake View Park and F-9 Park?', a: 'Lake View Park is a lakeside park on Rawal Lake with lawns, viewpoints, children’s activities and boating when operating — best for a longer water-focused family outing. F-9 Park (Fatima Jinnah Park) is a large central city park with green space and walking tracks, handy and lake-free.' },
    { q: 'Which is better for kids?', a: 'Both work for families. Lake View Park adds lake views and activities; F-9 Park is convenient if you’re already in the F-/G-sectors and want a quick green-space visit.' },
    { q: 'Which gets busier?', a: 'Both get busy at weekends; arrive earlier for space. Amenities, hours and charges differ, so check each park’s current information.' },
