>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Both are popular Islamabad green spaces, but they suit different plans. This comparison sticks to what each is known for rather than ranking facilities we haven’t verified.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Lake View Park</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">A lakeside park on Rawal Lake with open lawns, lake viewpoints, children’s activities and boating (when operating). It is the better pick if your plan centres on water views and a longer family outing.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">F-9 Park (Fatima Jinnah Park)</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">A large city park in the F-9 sector, known for open green space, walking tracks and a central location. It is a convenient, lake-free option close to the city, often used for exercise and casual family time.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Which to choose</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Want lake views, boating or a half-day family trip → Lake View Park.</li>
        <li>Want a quick city green space, a walk or to be near F-/G-sectors → F-9 Park.</li>
        <li>Both get busy at weekends; arrive earlier for space.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Not a facility ranking</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">Amenities, hours and charges differ between the two parks. Use each park’s own current information before you visit.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Pick for the plan, not the ranking</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Neither park is “better” in the abstract. Match the park to your day: Lake View Park for water and a longer outing, F-9 Park for a convenient city break. Either way, confirm current facilities and arrive early at weekends.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Choosing a park checklist" items={[
      'Want lake views or a half-day trip → Lake View Park.',
      'Want a quick city green space → F-9 Park.',
      'Arrive early at weekends at either park.',
      'Check each park’s current facilities and hours.',
    ]} />

